{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_015_1001_p", "source_sha256": "46d6925320dfff60c0bf56263e4c13ba837b535d20aac27c46d6156711186e87", "ja": "志保、お疲れさま。\nあ、公演のブログ、読んだぞ。", "zh": "志保，辛苦了。\n啊，我看了公演的部落格喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_015_1002_p", "source_sha256": "8ab76a8854afd90631fed9466d7c530655f1dce42559a938744f3cfbc2c23fe6", "ja": "いいメッセ―ジだったな。\n最近の公演があったからこそ、というか……。", "zh": "传达出的讯息很动人呢。\n算是最近这场公演给你的体悟吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_015_1003_033sih", "source_sha256": "c58563147314953b53bf01b674664a19e5e0a90272d8c2695f7599bd625721fe", "ja": "ありがとうございます。\nそれでは、今日はこれで……。", "zh": "谢谢你的夸奖。\n那么，我今天先离开了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_015_1004_p", "source_sha256": "430f86a4a1ffc24b0f13698589289dd9308d49b0d20897425f16282ee8c9efdc", "ja": "あれ。……そ、そうか、わかった。\nそれにしても、今日はいつにも増して早いんだな？", "zh": "咦？……这、这样啊，我知道了。\n话说回来，你今天好像比平时都还早离开？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_015_1005_033sih", "source_sha256": "59715dd29192009c1ab1ad08ebfc22a04c2f97e6790daa7847ae4cac2f98c363", "ja": "はい、これから可奈と茜さんと、\nプリンを食べに行かなくてはいけないので。", "zh": "对，我接下来得陪可奈和茜\n一起去吃布丁。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_015_1006_033sih", "source_sha256": "28a0b3f2b012ca19018ea4feb2e7b65a389cb1670839fa2d9efa9b008058db40", "ja": "あ、その、公演の後には行けなかったから、\nふたりにしつこく誘われて、それで……。", "zh": "啊，那个，因为公演结束之后没有去成，\n她们又一直缠着要我去，所以才……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_015_1007_033sih", "source_sha256": "83d9f1e132479d8298f916d19a4da915441e9cd76f2b6fd9bdaf572c1595c11c", "ja": "じゃあ……すみません。\nそろそろ待ち合わせ時間なので、行きます。", "zh": "那先这样……不好意思。\n差不多要到约好的时间了，我得走了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_015_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d5478f420e2fb5e7c82289c968ccb45909c55a434e987eabb58b0f0b2f964c6f", "ja": "ああ、引き止めて悪かったな。\n楽しんで来いよ！", "zh": "好，抱歉耽搁你了。\n玩得尽兴点喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_015_1009_033sih", "source_sha256": "68d18d3ccf42faaed8dfa9eab4d9851650aac0cc87a3bf583cf0ed4e008e96a2", "ja": "楽しめるかどうかはわかりませんけど……\n失礼します。では、また。", "zh": "我是不晓得自己能不能玩得尽兴……\n总之告辞了，下次再见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
